[{"text": "I now give the floor to her excellency", "start": 4.0, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Elisa Maria Dos Santos Amado Vaza,", "start": 6.96, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "Minister of State and for foreign", "start": 10.96, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "affairs, corporation and communities of", "start": 13.92, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "Sono Tommy Principi.", "start": 16.16, "duration": 4.28}, {"text": "your president.", "start": 37.52, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": ">> Mr. President,", "start": 39.68, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Mr. Secretary General, heads of state", "start": 42.48, "duration": 6.559}, {"text": "and governments, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 45.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "it is a great honor for me to take the", "start": 49.039, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "floor before this assembly on behalf of", "start": 51.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the government and the people of the", "start": 54.079, "duration": 7.841}, {"text": "Democratic Republic of Sto. and princip", "start": 56.8, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "allow me first of all to congratulate", "start": 61.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "his excellency Mr. Khalilur Rahman on", "start": 64.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "his election as president of the 81st", "start": 67.28, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "session of the general assembly and to", "start": 70.159, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "wish him every success in the discharge", "start": 73.76, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "of his duties.", "start": 76.72, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "I would also like to express our", "start": 78.72, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "appreciation to her excellency Miss", "start": 80.72, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Analena Bearbuk", "start": 82.96, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "for the work accomplished during the", "start": 85.439, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "previous session of the general", "start": 87.759, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 89.36, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Allow me to pay tribute to the secretary", "start": 92.24, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "general, his excellency Mr. Antonio", "start": 94.799, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Gutis for his commitment to peace,", "start": 97.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "sustainable development, human rights,", "start": 100.799, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and the strengthening of multilateralism", "start": 103.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "at a time of great challenges.", "start": 106.799, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Excellencies, we live in a context", "start": 110.56, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "marked by conflicts,", "start": 113.439, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "geopolitical rivalries, economic", "start": 115.759, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "uncertainty, climate change, force", "start": 118.799, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "displacement, inequalities,", "start": 122.0, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "transnational crime, and rapid", "start": 125.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "technological transformation.", "start": 128.479, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "No state can face challenges of this", "start": 131.36, "duration": 6.84}, {"text": "magnitude alone.", "start": 134.239, "duration": 3.961}, {"text": "For sto and principy, this reality", "start": 138.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "underscores the importance of an", "start": 141.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "international order based on the charter", "start": 143.84, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "of the United Nations, international law", "start": 146.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and the sovereign equality of states", "start": 149.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "with principles applied universally and", "start": 152.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "consistently.", "start": 155.28, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "As a small island nation, we stand as a", "start": 158.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "consolidated democracy and a state", "start": 161.68, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "governed by the rule of law, grounded in", "start": 164.56, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "peace, stability, and harmonious", "start": 168.08, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "coexistence among our citizens. It is on", "start": 170.319, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "the basis of this experience that we", "start": 173.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "reaffirm our confidence in dialogue,", "start": 176.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "diplomacy, cooperation, and the peaceful", "start": 179.28, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "settlement of disputes. Mr. Present for", "start": 182.4, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "small island developing states", "start": 186.159, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "geographic, economic, financial and", "start": 188.879, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "social vulnerabilities", "start": 191.44, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "are compounded by the effects of climate", "start": 193.36, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "change in Sto and Principi. These", "start": 196.159, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "impacts are already affecting our", "start": 199.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "coastal areas, infrastructure, marine", "start": 202.0, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "resources and livelihoods", "start": 205.44, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "despite our negligible contribution to", "start": 208.48, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "global emissions.", "start": 212.4, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "This reality reflects a profound climate", "start": 218.08, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "injustice.", "start": 221.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Sto and Principi therefore reaffirms its", "start": 223.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "commitments under the Paris agreement,", "start": 227.68, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "its nationally determined contribution", "start": 230.72, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "and its national adaptation plan while", "start": 234.64, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "stressing that their implementation", "start": 238.48, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "requires adequate, predictable and", "start": 240.799, "duration": 7.241}, {"text": "accessible resources.", "start": 244.239, "duration": 3.801}, {"text": "We also maintain that the vulnerability", "start": 248.239, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "of small island states should be", "start": 250.64, "duration": 5.999}, {"text": "assessed beyond per capita income taking", "start": 253.12, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "into account their specific", "start": 256.639, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "characteristics and structural", "start": 258.479, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "constraints. In this context, we call", "start": 260.56, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "for the multi-dimensional vulnerability", "start": 264.0, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "index to be translated into concrete", "start": 266.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "eligibility criteria for concessional", "start": 270.4, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "financing. We likewise advocate for the", "start": 273.52, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "full oper operationalization", "start": 276.479, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "of the fund for responding to loss and", "start": 279.6, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "damage and simpler more effective access", "start": 282.639, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "to the green climate fund. The limited", "start": 286.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "institutional capacity of vulnerable", "start": 289.759, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "countries must not become an obstacle", "start": 292.0, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "for to accessing the very instruments", "start": 294.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "created to support them. In the case of", "start": 297.919, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Sto and Principi, this issue is", "start": 300.24, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "particularly relevant following our", "start": 302.479, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "graduation to middle inome country", "start": 304.96, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "status which was an important milestone", "start": 307.28, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "and a recognition of the progress", "start": 310.4, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "achieved in human development. It", "start": 312.479, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "nonetheless requires appropriate", "start": 314.8, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "transition measures capable of", "start": 317.84, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "consolidating these gains and shielding", "start": 320.639, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "the country from external shocks.", "start": 323.36, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "It is as part of this effort of", "start": 327.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "consolidation and that the energy", "start": 329.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "transition finds its place.", "start": 332.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "A transition that is for us an economic,", "start": 335.6, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "financial, social, and environmental", "start": 338.72, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "necessity. In an island economy", "start": 340.96, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "dependent on imported fuel, the cost and", "start": 344.479, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "reliability of electricity affect every", "start": 347.759, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "sector. The implementation of our energy", "start": 350.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "transition program and the national", "start": 354.4, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "energy compact should contribute to a", "start": 357.68, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "cleaner, more affordable, secure and", "start": 360.8, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "stable system, but it will require", "start": 363.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "investment and international", "start": 367.28, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "partnerships.", "start": 369.44, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "Excellencies, food security and the", "start": 371.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "strengthening of productive capacity are", "start": 373.759, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "urgent priorities. We seek to reduce our", "start": 376.88, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "dependence on imports, increase national", "start": 380.08, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "production, and ensure better market", "start": 383.199, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "access for farmers so that a greater", "start": 386.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "share of the value generated by quality", "start": 389.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "products such as cocoa and coffee", "start": 392.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "remains in the country. If the land is", "start": 395.44, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "essential to our food security, the sea", "start": 398.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and our biodiversity represent one of", "start": 401.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "the broadest horizons for our", "start": 404.08, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "development.", "start": 406.24, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "The recognition of our territory by", "start": 407.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "UNESCO as a world biosphere reserve", "start": 409.84, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "confirms the exceptional value of our", "start": 413.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "natural heritage and reinforces our", "start": 416.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "responsibility to protect it and make", "start": 419.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the most of it. We aim to turn this", "start": 421.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "wealth into opportunities for", "start": 424.8, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "sustainable development through", "start": 427.36, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "fisheries, the blue economy, research,", "start": 429.039, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and nature-based tourism that generates", "start": 431.84, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "jobs and income for local communities.", "start": 435.199, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "At the same time, in the face of threats", "start": 438.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "posed by illegal fishing and", "start": 441.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "transnational crime, Sto\u00e9 and Principe", "start": 443.36, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "will continue to work with the states of", "start": 446.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the region and international partners to", "start": 449.039, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "strengthen maritime security and promote", "start": 452.4, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "a sustainable blue economy, thus", "start": 455.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "preserving our resources for future", "start": 458.96, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "generations.", "start": 461.28, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "The preservation of these resources and", "start": 463.919, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "the building of sustainable development", "start": 465.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "ultimately depend on people and on the", "start": 468.72, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "opportunities afforded to them. The", "start": 471.039, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "future of Sto\u00e9 and Principi hinges on", "start": 473.759, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "our ability to create opportunities for", "start": 476.879, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "the next generation. Our priority is to", "start": 479.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "ensure that young people have the", "start": 483.12, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "conditions to study, work, start", "start": 485.199, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "businesses, innovate and fulfill their", "start": 487.919, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "life aspirations in their own country.", "start": 491.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "In a nation of our size, every talent", "start": 494.879, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "counts and every young person is an", "start": 497.28, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "indispensable force for national", "start": 500.08, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "progress.", "start": 502.639, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "Likewise, the Santoan diaspora is an", "start": 504.879, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "essential part of our human wealth and a", "start": 507.84, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "strategic partner of the country. We", "start": 510.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "will continue to strengthen its ties", "start": 513.599, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "with Stomen Principi and to create the", "start": 515.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "conditions for an even greater", "start": 518.719, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "contribution to investment,", "start": 520.64, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "entrepreneurship, knowledge transfer,", "start": 522.8, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "and national life. Mr. president.", "start": 525.279, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "Creating opportunities and ensuring", "start": 529.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "truly inclusive development require", "start": 531.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "strong institutions capable of", "start": 534.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "guaranteeing peace, justice, respect for", "start": 536.88, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "human rights and the participation of", "start": 540.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "all in the life of the country. There", "start": 543.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "can be no sustainable development", "start": 546.0, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "without these conditions, nor without", "start": 548.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "the full participation of women and men", "start": 551.2, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "in political, economic and social life.", "start": 553.44, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "It is in this context that 2026 is a", "start": 558.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "year of particular significance for", "start": 561.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Santomean democracy.", "start": 563.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "On July 19th, our citizens took part in", "start": 566.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "presidential elections which were", "start": 569.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "conducted peacefully and transparently", "start": 571.92, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "and led to the election of his", "start": 575.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "excellency Mr. Carlos Villanova as", "start": 577.279, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "president of the republic.", "start": 580.399, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "On September 27th, the people of Stoto", "start": 583.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and Principi will return to the polls", "start": 586.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "for the legislative, local, and regional", "start": 589.2, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "elections and will exercise their right", "start": 592.399, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "to vote in large numbers. These", "start": 595.2, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "elections are marked by important", "start": 597.839, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "innovations, notably automatic voter", "start": 599.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "registration and the first application", "start": 603.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "of the parity law, which is a", "start": 605.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "significant step towards strengthening", "start": 608.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the inclusion and participation of", "start": 610.88, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "women.", "start": 613.6, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "With women accounting for 41.4% 4% of", "start": 616.079, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "confirmed candidacies", "start": 620.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "above the legal threshold of 40% they", "start": 622.32, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "will be able to assert a growing", "start": 625.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "presence in decisionmaking spaces.", "start": 627.44, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Santo and Principi reaffirms its", "start": 630.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "commitment to constitutional order,", "start": 633.519, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "political pluralism, fundamental", "start": 636.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "freedoms, and respect for the sovereign", "start": 638.959, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "will of its citizens and will continue", "start": 641.68, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "to pursue reforms aimed at strengthening", "start": 644.88, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "justice, security, gender equality,", "start": 648.56, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "human rights, and trust in institutions.", "start": 651.519, "duration": 5.161}, {"text": "Inclusion and equality must also guide", "start": 656.959, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "our response to the great", "start": 659.12, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "transformations of our time. In the face", "start": 660.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "of the rapid advance of artificial", "start": 664.079, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "intelligence and the digital transition,", "start": 666.8, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Sto\u00e9 and Principi calls for", "start": 670.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "international cooperation that enables", "start": 672.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "developing countries to access the", "start": 675.04, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "technology,", "start": 678.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "knowledge, infrastructure and financing", "start": 680.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "they need. We advocate responsible", "start": 682.56, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "technology governance centered on human", "start": 685.519, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "dignity, transparency and fundamental", "start": 688.64, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "rights so that innovation translates", "start": 691.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "into better opportunities and services", "start": 694.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "for all. Excellencies, the experience of", "start": 696.88, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Stomen principally as a small democracy", "start": 700.48, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "also shapes the way we view", "start": 703.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "representation at the international", "start": 706.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "level. Africa today occupies a", "start": 708.16, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "demographic, economic and political", "start": 710.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "place that is not yet adequately", "start": 713.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "reflected in the institutions where the", "start": 715.92, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "most far-reaching decisions are taken.", "start": 719.2, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "It is in this area that reform of the", "start": 722.64, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "security council becomes imperative.", "start": 725.92, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "This is not a concession to Africa. It", "start": 729.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "is a matter of legitimacy,", "start": 731.36, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "justice and effectiveness. An", "start": 733.92, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "institution responsible for", "start": 736.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "international peace and security cannot", "start": 738.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "remain indefinitely based on a", "start": 741.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "distribution of power inherited from", "start": 743.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "another area. In the pursuit of greater", "start": 746.48, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "historical justice and representation,", "start": 749.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Santo and Principi therefore welcomes", "start": 751.92, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the recent decisions that recognize the", "start": 754.32, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "historical gravity of the transatlantic", "start": 757.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "trafficking of enslaved Africans and", "start": 761.12, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "promoted a more accurate ctographic", "start": 764.32, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "representation of the size of the", "start": 767.68, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "continents", "start": 769.76, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "correcting distortions that visually", "start": 771.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "diminished Africa.", "start": 773.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "These acts of recognition must translate", "start": 776.88, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "into an international order in which", "start": 779.2, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Africa participates fully in shaping the", "start": 782.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "future rather than remaining merely in", "start": 784.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "the position of responding to this", "start": 787.76, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "decisions taken elsewhere. Mr.", "start": 790.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "President, peace remains the very debt", "start": 792.88, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "of the multilateral system. Stomen", "start": 796.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "principi follows with concern the", "start": 799.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "conflicts in Ukraine, the Sudan, the", "start": 802.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "Sahel, the Great Lakes region, the Horn", "start": 805.2, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "of Africa and the Middle East, and calls", "start": 808.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "for stronger diplomacy and the", "start": 811.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "protection of civilians in accordance", "start": 813.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "with the charter of the United Nations", "start": 815.6, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "and international law. We likewise call", "start": 817.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "for respect for international", "start": 821.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "humanitarian law, full humanitarian", "start": 822.959, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "access, and the release of hostages. We", "start": 826.16, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "reaffirm our support for a two-state", "start": 830.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "solution that allows Israel and", "start": 832.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Palestine to live side by side in peace", "start": 834.32, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "and security on the basis of", "start": 837.44, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "international law and the relevant", "start": 839.839, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "United Nations resolutions. We also", "start": 842.399, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "followed with concern the persistence of", "start": 845.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the economic, commercial, and financial", "start": 847.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "restrictions affecting Cuba and call for", "start": 850.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "their lifting for the benefit of the", "start": 853.839, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "development and well-being of the Cuban", "start": 856.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "people to whom we express our", "start": 859.12, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "solidarity.", "start": 862.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "Excellency Stomen Principi will remain", "start": 864.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "faithful to the charter of the United", "start": 866.639, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Nations, international law, peace, human", "start": 868.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "rights and multilateralism,", "start": 872.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "standing as a voice of dialogue and", "start": 874.8, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "moderation and as a committed partner", "start": 877.04, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "for stability in the Gulf of Guinea. On", "start": 880.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "the eve of the elections in Stomen", "start": 883.199, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Principi, it is important to acknowledge", "start": 885.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the progress made in a challenging", "start": 887.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "context. The government has launched", "start": 890.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "reforms and made advances in", "start": 892.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "infrastructure, the energy transition,", "start": 895.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "digitalization, and investment", "start": 898.56, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "attraction, creating the conditions to", "start": 900.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "mobilize resources needed to meet our", "start": 903.04, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "population's most pressing needs,", "start": 906.32, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "particularly in access to health, water,", "start": 909.12, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "sanitation, justice, and security,", "start": 912.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "environmental protection, and the", "start": 915.839, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "infrastructure essential to development.", "start": 918.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "as aligned with the national strategy", "start": 922.8, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "based on sustainable tourism", "start": 926.56, "duration": 10.0}, {"text": "2026 2040. We thank all of our bilateral", "start": 931.76, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "and multilateral partners who are", "start": 936.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "supporting Sto and Principi in this", "start": 938.399, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "process.", "start": 941.12, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "However, the challenge before us is to", "start": 942.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "turn these advances into concrete and", "start": 945.199, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "lasting results. Consolidating the", "start": 947.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "foundations for more inclusive,", "start": 950.8, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "sustainable and resilient development", "start": 953.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "for each ensuring continuity and", "start": 957.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "stability of government and of", "start": 960.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "governance is paramount. Mr. President,", "start": 962.639, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "our vulnerabilities as a small island", "start": 965.92, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "developing state do not define our", "start": 968.72, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "horizon. We therefore reaffirm our", "start": 971.519, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "determination to turn challenges into", "start": 974.079, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "opportunities", "start": 976.72, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "through strategic partnerships based on", "start": 978.399, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "shared responsibility and mutual", "start": 980.88, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "benefit. and we reaffirm our capacity to", "start": 983.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "contribute to peace, uphold the", "start": 986.959, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "principles of the charter of the United", "start": 989.36, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Nations, and participate responsibly in", "start": 992.0, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "building solutions to the challenges we", "start": 995.199, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "collectively face. We call on all member", "start": 998.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "states to continue building together a", "start": 1001.519, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "more representative, supportive and just", "start": 1004.639, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "international order founded on respect", "start": 1008.079, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "for the sovereignty of states,", "start": 1011.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "international law and equality of", "start": 1013.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "opportunity. It is in this spirit of", "start": 1016.88, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "peace, dialogue and hope that Sto\u00e9 and", "start": 1019.279, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Principi will continue to shoulder its", "start": 1022.639, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "responsibility within the international", "start": 1024.799, "duration": 7.321}, {"text": "community. Thank you, Mr. President", "start": 1027.12, "duration": 5.0}, {"text": "I thank StoP. Thank you.", "start": 1045.919, "duration": 5.16}]